  "name": "EFC Gradient-Coupled Grid Action",
  "description": "Derives the EFC screening relation E ∝ √g from a minimal three-term Lagrangian S_grid with gradient coupling ½α|∇Φ|(∇ξ)². Establishes operator uniqueness by eliminating four alternative couplings.",
  "url": "https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.31941465",
